# ============================================================
# TASK ROUTING ENGINE — SUPPORT DOCUMENT
# ============================================================
# This engine maps task types to the modules responsible for
# executing them. It ensures deterministic routing across the
# entire Ardhanarishvara ecosystem.
#
# RESPONSIBILITIES:
#   - Register task → module mappings
#   - Resolve which module should handle a given task
#   - Maintain routing history
#
# Used by:
#   - Job Scheduling Engine
#   - Pipeline Execution Engine
#   - Orchestrator
